    "deliberately built OUT in the two places scripts/cds-gs/CATALOG_GAPS.md found",
    "its own catalog too thin for this kind of paper: public finance/money-and-",
    "banking, and defence-as-institutions.",
    "",
    "Paper 2 (CSAT) has no .docx at all. Its five subjects follow the official CSAT",
    "syllabus, and every chapter below is anchored to a question type actually",
    "observed in the CSP 2025 booklet (data sufficiency, number theory, coding,",
    "time-and-work, series, comprehension, ordering/inequality) rather than copied",
